WEBVTT

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.230
Are you sure these chocolates are okay, miss?

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:12.150
Just who do you think I am?

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:15.030
I'm Irina Jelavich, the Seductive Witch!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.870
And a witch's secret tonics
are the finest seasoning.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.240
Those boys are done for.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.200
Done for?

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.370
Even Commander Karasuma...

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.000
We're perfectly okay
making the usual obligatory chocolates...

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.250
Just watch.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.840
I'll show those E Class boys
what a witch can do, all right.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.090
That stuff looks way sketchy!

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:55.360
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:04.790
"Nagisa"

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:06.460
"Karma"

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:07.460
"Kaede"

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:08.790
"Isogai" "Maehara"

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.460
"Rio" "Okuda" "Sugino" "Kanzaki"

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:12.960
"Itona" "Ritsu"

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.470
"Chiba" "Hayami" "Hinata" "Meg"

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:16.970
"Hinano" "Takebayashi" "Toka" "Justice"

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:18.970
"Muramatsu" "Kirara" "Yoshida" "Terasaka"

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:20.970
"Okajima" "Hara" "Mimura" "Fuwa" "Sugaya"

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:22.970
"Karasuma" "Irina"

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:39.280
"Takebayashi, Leaving the E Class?"

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:40.530
"The next day"

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:41.870
"Feb. 14"

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.450
Seriously?

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.290
You're giving this to me?!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:50.040
"Effort" "Talent" "Victory"

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:48.170
Got a problem? Then give 'em back!

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.790
No--I'm totally stoked!

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:51.670
Are you sure?

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.250
Well, I <i>do</i> always tease the life out of you.

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:56.050
Consider it an apology of sorts, too.

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:59.680
Here you go--you, too, Kimura and Sugaya.

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:03.100
--Ooh!
--I know it doesn't mean anything,
but I'm still thrilled!

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:07.180
Aw! I wanted to give some
to Commander Karasuma, too.

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:09.230
But he's nowhere to be found!

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.820
Whoa!

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.650
Yesss...

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.820
--Yesss! Yesss! Yesss! Yesss!

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:18.820
"Chocolates from Kanzaki (a formality)"

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:19.530
--I'm glad you're so happy.
--Yesss! Yesss! Yesss! Yesss!

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:23.120
Chill out, Sugino.
I know you're happy and all, but geez.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:26.040
Man, I can't stop eating these!

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:28.540
Yeah, they're way too tasty!

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:32.210
Are there any more? C'mon, gimme more!

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:33.460
Huh?

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:36.420
--Chocolates... chocolates...

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.170
--Whaaat?!
--Chocolates... chocolates...

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.220
--Chocolates...

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:41.690
--What happened?
--Chocolates...

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.430
These chocolates...

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:47.100
They contain a strong love potion
<i>and</i> an addictive poison!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:50.620
--They do?!
--Yes. Make no mistake: the chocolates...

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.690
The chocolates... choco... choc...

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:55.940
<i>Chocolates</i>!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.940
--Okuda?!
--Chocolates...

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:04.200
--Cho... chocolates...!
--Get away from me!

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.120
Chocolates... chocolates!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:12.120
--Professor Bitch never said <i>this</i> would happen!
--Chocolates...

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:15.590
--Give me chocolates...!
--Hey! Don't even!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:18.090
--Chocolates!
--Who are you trying to kid?

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:20.920
You never <i>got</i> any chocolates--
quit playing zombie!

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:23.840
Hands off! These are <i>my</i> chocolates!

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.020
--<i>My</i> chocolates, from Kanzaki!
--Sugino! You're all right!

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:29.890
Yeah! I was gonna keep these
as a family treasure,

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.940
but if they're just gonna get stolen...

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:35.900
Sugino! Don't tell me Kanzaki
was with the Professor Bitch bunch?!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.260
Nuh-uh. Mine's just regular
store-bought chocolate.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.160
--Kanzaki's chocolates are <i>crazy</i>!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:45.490
--Sugino!
--Kanzaki's chocolates are <i>crazy</i>!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.160
Clearly the craziest thing
around here is Sugino!

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.950
That's Sugino's bug.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:54.170
It seems when he reaches peak excitement,
he becomes a berserker.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.500
A berserker?!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.460
This isn't good! We've got to stop Sugino!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.220
But given the circumstances...

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.010
--Chocolates...
--Gimme chocolates...

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.470
--Chocolates...!
--Gimme chocolates...

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.680
In that case...

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:09.310
Hey, gang! If you want
these chocolates, stop Sugino!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.900
Well, that'll get us <i>somwhere</i>, anyway.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.230
I'm hearing some pretty frenzied shouts.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.320
You didn't put anything
weird in these, did you?

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:30.040
"Effort" "Talent" "Victory"

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.160
As if!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:27.910
Why would you even
say such a thing! What a jerk!

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.480
--Let me go!
--No way!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.620
"The day after that"

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.830
Man... yesterday was a real mess.

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.750
I'm sorry it got to me, too.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.340
Thank goodness the effects only lasted a day.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.720
Sugino's not changing back.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.800
You're leaving the E Class?!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.140
What's this all about, Takebayashi?

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.640
It's a done deal.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.560
Hey, what's going on?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.440
And what's <i>he</i> doing here?

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.820
Takebayashi says he's
quitting our class to join the paladins.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.990
Changing from an E Class weakling
into one of the strong--a paladin.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.780
Not such a bad deal.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.160
One of the strong, eh?

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.120
Smell anything fishy?

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:14.040
He's right. An elite group
pulling someone out of the misfit E Class?

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.830
There's got to be more to it.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:21.170
Maybe they want inside info
on Koro Sensei--I mean, the Big Bad.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.920
Pull yourself together, Takebayashi!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.800
We're going to beat
the Big Bad together, right?

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:29.390
Hmph! When you got all worked up
over a little chocolate?

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:32.290
One look at your shameful selves and I knew:

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.270
the E Class really is the 
bottom of the barrel.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.230
Takebayashi...

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.860
I must succeed...

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:47.570
"Watch for Fire Hazards"

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:42.320
...in part, to gain the approval
of my strict parents.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.270
In this class, that'll never happen.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.240
And what's more...

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:51.080
--I'm <i>sure</i> I'll get chocolates 
once I'm a paladin!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.790
--<i>That's</i> what clinched it?!
--I'm <i>sure</i> I'll get chocolates once I'm a paladin!

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.580
Calm down, Takebayashi!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.500
Don't quit because of <i>that</i>!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.000
You popular kids just don't get it.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.710
"Assassination Classroom"
"Thank You and Goodbye"

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.170
Of all our postcards on Shinjuku Promenade,

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.510
mine was the last to be taken!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:07.840
Stop, Takebayashi!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.590
Keep those masochistic details
to yourself and no one's the wiser!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.600
What are you <i>talking</i> about?!

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.140
Koro-Q.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:13.560
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.350
Let me go!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:20.810
--I'll join the paladins and
get chocolates at my usual maid café!

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.810
--So now what?
I've tied him up for now, anyway.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:21.400
--So now what?
I've tied him up for now, anyway.
--Maids! Chocolate!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:24.070
--And after we've all come so far together...
--Maids! Chocolate!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:26.440
--Can we get him to stay somehow?
--"Welcome back, master!"

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.650
--Ideally, we'd all defeat
Koro Sensei as a group.
--Chocolates!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:29.820
--Ideally, we'd all defeat
Koro Sensei as a group.
--For me! At last!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.070
--How about <i>this</i>?
--For me! At last!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.240
Let me <i>go</i>!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.870
Oh, master!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.830
"Adorable"

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:37.830
If it's maids you want...

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:39.790
...there are plenty of them...

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.540
...right here!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.750
--Whoa!
--Pinch me!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.210
How'd I get roped into this?
It doesn't suit me at all.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.720
Try not to look at us.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.050
How'd <i>I</i> get roped into this?!

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.510
And how does that look
better on you than on a girl?

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:56.890
Say...

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.560
If there's anything
you'd like us to do, master...

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.650
...we'll do it.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:03.190
What happened to you, Yada?!

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:05.610
This is ero-tech handed down
directly from Professor Bitch!

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.900
It'll take Takebayashi down like <i>that</i>!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.280
"But it had no effect on Takebayashi!"

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.280
It's not working at all!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.460
If you want to be my maid,

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.410
<i>first</i>...

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.670
...you must discard one whole dimension!

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:24.130
His expression didn't change at all
in the face of those big boobs...

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.750
He's a force to be reckoned with!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.130
Koro-Q!

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.760
"Koro Sensei Quest"

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.340
Don't be such a sourpuss, Takebayashi.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.130
The E Class has its good points, too!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:32.760
Hmph.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.390
That's rich. You have
even fewer parts than I do.

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.350
"Sugaya and Kimura were dealt
a most regrettable blow!"

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.560
And <i>you</i>...

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.930
<i>You</i> got <i>chocolates</i>!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:42.390
So that <i>is</i> the clincher.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:47.070
We are a team, my friend!

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:50.030
"You're a dear friend to us!"

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.320
And aren't you an impostor?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.950
He's more stubborn than I thought.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.780
Of all the times for our teachers
not to be around...

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.160
What should we do?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.120
Will you leave this to me, everyone?

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:03.170
--Ritsu?
--I've been watching this class
ever since I joined it.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.540
--I've been watching this class
ever since I joined it.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:10.800
I can see that if even one of us is missing,
we can't defeat the Big Bad.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:15.050
I'm now calculating the best way
to keep Takebayashi here.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:17.470
Got it:

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.270
I'll use my magic!

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:21.140
Magic?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.940
I'm picking up on some strong magic power!

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:24.550
Takebayashi?

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:30.000
Come. Be with me.

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.510
Takebayashi!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:39.660
What did you do, Ritsu?

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:40.620
Magic!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.250
Was it <i>really</i> magic?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:43.620
Magic!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.830
Hey! What are you eating?!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.630
I realized something inside Ritsu:

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.260
People like you who get worked up
over a little chocolate

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:58.280
could really use a level-headed person...

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:01.180
...like me.

00:09:03.230 --> 00:09:06.900
I suppose I could try
being a party-supporting hero, too.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:11.440
I... don't really get it, but I'm glad
you're sticking around, Takebayashi.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.650
What did you do with your magic, anyway?

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:14.820
That's a secret!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.620
"Takebayashi's level increased a little bit"

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.320
--♪ Once this season comes for me ♪

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:23.250
--You're gonna <i>sing</i>?!
--♪ Once this season comes for me ♪

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:29.310
♪ I won't be able ♪

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:35.220
♪ To search out your figure anymore ♪

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:40.640
♪ I'll never forget ♪

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:47.240
♪ Until the day I can see you again ♪
